// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table : CoPThePerfectEyeChoice 
// 		Row 2174 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table Description :
"P2295952398" "You have completed the Cathedral of Pain Trial.  The Perfect Eye item of power stands before you, select your reward."
// Choice Description :
"P1959977803" "<b><color orange>Penumbra of Rularuu</b></color><br><br>By choosing this reward, you will receive a single Penumbra of Rularuu.  This common component can be used to create Incarnate Abilities for your Alpha Slot."
// Choice Description :
"P2849726640" "<b><color orange>The Perfect Eye</color></b><br><br>By selecting this reward you will be bestowed with the energies of the Perfect Eye item of power.  The benefits of this power will last for 7 days of real time.  While this power lasts, the user will gain a Perception and Accuracy bonus.  In addition to this power, the user will gain a small amount of merit rewards.  Repeating this task multiple times within a 24 hour period will yield reduced Merit Rewards upon completion.  <i><color red>NOTE: Selecting this reward will replace any existing Item of Power temporary powers on the user.</color></i>"
// Choice Warning :
"P1487076205" "You already own this Item of Power temporary power."
// Choice Description :
"P2755201545" "<b><color orange>Merit Reward Tokens</color></b><br><br>By choosing this reward, you will receive a number of Merit Reward Tokens.  The number of merits granted from this reward option is greater than from the reward option above.  Repeating this task multiple times within a 24 hour period will yield reduced Merit Rewards upon completion."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table : CoPTheTrueFurnaceChoice 
// 		Row 2216 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table Description :
"P2290924572" "You have completed the Cathedral of Pain Trial.  The True Furnace item of power stands before you, select your reward."
// Choice Description :
"P2516130718" "<b><color orange>The True Furnace</color></b><br><br>By selecting this reward you will be bestowed with the energies of the True Furnace item of power.  The benefits of this power will last for 7 days of real time.  While this power lasts, the user will gain a bonus to their Maximum Endurance as well as some resistance to Endurance Drain effects.  In addition to this power, the user will gain a small amount of merit rewards.  Repeating this task multiple times within a 24 hour period will yield reduced Merit Rewards upon completion.  <i><color red>NOTE: Selecting this reward will replace any existing Item of Power temporary powers on the user.</color></i>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table : CoPHeartofaStormElementalChoice 
// 		Row 2258 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table Description :
"P807083441" "You have completed the Cathedral of Pain Trial.  The Heart of a Storm Elemental item of power stands before you, select your reward."
// Choice Description :
"P2847894876" "<b><color orange>The Heart of a Storm Elemental</color></b><br><br>By selecting this reward you will be bestowed with the energies of the Heart of a Storm Elemental item of power.  The benefits of this power will last for 7 days of real time.  While this power lasts, the user will gain a bonus to their Maximum Hit Points as well as an increase to their Regeneration rate.  In addition to this power, the user will gain a small amount of merit rewards.  Repeating this task multiple times within a 24 hour period will yield reduced Merit Rewards upon completion.  <i><color red>NOTE: Selecting this reward will replace any existing Item of Power temporary powers on the user.</color></i>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table : CoPAngerMonumentChoice 
// 		Row 2300 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table Description :
"P849446553" "You have completed the Cathedral of Pain Trial.  The Anger Monument item of power stands before you, select your reward."
// Choice Description :
"P350750310" "<b><color orange>The Anger Monument</color></b><br><br>By selecting this reward you will be bestowed with the energies of the Anger Monument item of power.  The benefits of this power will last for 7 days of real time.  While this power lasts, the user will gain a bonus to Damage output.  In addition to this power, the user will gain a small amount of merit rewards.  Repeating this task multiple times within a 24 hour period will yield reduced Merit Rewards upon completion.  <i><color red>NOTE: Selecting this reward will replace any existing Item of Power temporary powers on the user.</color></i>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table : CoPCrystalofResistanceChoice 
// 		Row 2342 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table Description :
"P2650896619" "You have completed the Cathedral of Pain Trial.  The Crystal of Resistance item of power stands before you, select your reward."
// Choice Description :
"P255043599" "<b><color orange>Alpha Incarnate Slot Unlock</color></b><br><br>By choosing this reward, you will have your Alpha Incarnate Slot Unlocked.  This will give you the ability to greatly increase your power."
// Choice Description :
"P1484620885" "<b><color orange>Penumbra of Rularuu<br></color></b><br>By choosing this reward, you will receive a single Penumbra of Rularuu.  This common component can be used to create Incarnate Abilities for your Alpha Slot."
// Choice Description :
"P3007608389" "<b><color orange>The Crystal of Resistance</color></b><br><br>By selecting this reward you will be bestowed with the energies of the Crystal of Resistance item of power.  The benefits of this power will last for 7 days of real time.  While this power lasts, the user will gain a large bonus to their ability to resist Hold, Immobilize, Sleep and Stun effects.  In addition to this power, the user will gain a small amount of merit rewards.  Repeating this task multiple times within a 24 hour period will yield reduced Merit Rewards upon completion.  <i><color red>NOTE: Selecting this reward will replace any existing Item of Power temporary powers on the user.</color></i>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table : Halloween2010Choice 
// 		Row 2384 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table Description :
"P2884170827" "You have recovered the Malleus Mundi. A wealth of possibilities opens up before you as to what you shall do with such a powerful tome..."
// Choice Description :
"P376641854" "<b><color orange>Keep The Malleus Mundi secure</color></b><br><br>In order to prevent this from happening again, you decide that the best protector of the Malleus Mundi is yourself.<br><br>By choosing this reward, you will receive the Secured badge and a piece of rare Arcane Salvage."
// Choice Description :
"P950643348" "<b><color orange>Keep The Malleus Mundi secure</color></b><br><br>In order to prevent this from happening again, you decide that the best protector of the Malleus Mundi is yourself.<br><br>By choosing this reward, you will receive a random Large Inspiration."
// Choice Description :
"P1204131149" "<b><color orange>Use the Malleus Mundi to gain personal power</color></b><br><br>Oh yeah, this thing is REAL power. You can USE this.<br><br>By choosing this reward, you will receive the Power Hungry badge and a rare Invention Recipe."
// Choice Description :
"P514842477" "<b><color orange>Use the Malleus Mundi to gain personal power</color></b><br><br>Oh yeah, this thing is REAL power. You can USE this.<br><br>By choosing this reward, you will receive a random Large Inspiration."
// Choice Description :
"P1912576175" "<b><color orange>Attempt to destroy the Malleus Mundi</color></b><br><br>It might not be permanent, but you'll make the effort.<br><br>By choosing this reward, you will receive the Artifact Destroyer badge and a piece of rare Arcane Salvage."
// Choice Description :
"P3444833015" "<b><color orange>Attempt to destroy the Malleus Mundi</color></b><br><br>It might not be permanent, but you'll make the effort.<br><br>By choosing this reward, you will receive a random Large Inspiration."
// Choice Description :
"P1294473713" "<b><color orange>Hide the Malleus Mundi</color></b><br><br>Can a magical artifact such as this ever truly be hidden?<br><br>By choosing this reward, you will receive the Veiled badge, a Rock Temporary Power, and a random Large Inspiration."
// Choice Description :
"P2592753557" "<b><color orange>Hide the Malleus Mundi</color></b><br><br>Can a magical artifact such as this ever truly be hidden?<br><br>By choosing this reward, you will receive a random Large Inspiration."
// Choice Description :
"P1297813419" "<b><color orange>Sell the Malleus Mundi to the highest bidder</color></b><br><br>Time to profit off your hard work.<br><br>By choosing this reward, you will receive the Arriviste badge and 100,000 inf.<br><br><color red>WARNING: The Arriviste badge will replace the Trusting badge."
// Choice Description :
"P1987525065" "<b><color orange>Sell the Malleus Mundi to the highest bidder</color></b><br><br>Time to profit off your hard work.<br><br>By choosing this reward, you will receive 5,000 inf."
// Choice Description :
"P1353412511" "<b><color orange>Send the Malleus Mundi to MAGI</color></b><br><br>It might not be <i>completely</i> secure, but you could gain some influence out of the donation.<br><br>By choosing this reward, you will receive the Trusting badge and 100,000 inf.<br><br><color red>WARNING: The Trusting badge will replace the Arriviste badge."
// Choice Description :
"P381021840" "<b><color orange>Send the Malleus Mundi to MAGI</color></b><br><br>It might not be <i>completely</i> secure, but you could gain some influence out of the donation.<br><br>By choosing this reward, you will receive 5,000 inf."

