// Table Description :
"P2843465866" "You have completed the Apex Task Force and helped save the world from Battle Maiden's rampage.  Select your reward from the following options:"
// Choice Description :
"P2672158074" "<b><color purple>Astral Merit</b></color><br><br>By choosing this reward, you will receive a single Astral Merit.  This rare salvage can be used to purchase Incarnate rewards from vendors in Ouroboros, or can be converted into threads to help in constructing Incarnate abilities."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table : AlphaTFShardsTinMageChoice 
// 		Row 2652 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table Description :
"P1711174037" "You have completed the Tin Mage Task Force and helped save the world from Neuron's machinations.  Select your reward from the following options:"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table : NTutorialMoralChoice 
// 		Row 2687 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Choice Description :
"P403252061" "<b><font face=title><scale 1.25><span align=center><color DeepSkyBlue>Save the Blue Spectrum's Life!</font></color></scale></b><br><br>Allow the Blue Spectrum to absorb some of your powers!<br><br><color DeepSkyBlue><b>Choosing this will make you a HERO</color></b></span>"
// Choice Description :
"P2022122931" "<b><font face=title><scale 1.25><span align=center><color Red>Steal the Blue Spectrum's Powers!</font></color></scale></b><br><br>While the Blue Spectrum is weakened, take his power for yourself!<br><br><b><color Red>Choosing this will make you a VILLAIN</color></b></span>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table : SL1SewerTrialRewardtable 
// 		Row 2697 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table Description :
"P2289378540" "You have defeated the Hydra heads beneath Paragon City and have earned the right to be empowered by their chemicals!"
// Choice Description :
"P3163533784" "<b><color orange>Damage Increase</b></color><br><br>The Hydra chemicals will slightly increase your <color red>damage</color>. This will last for one week in game time or until you have hit level 22."
// Choice Description :
"P3635981124" "<b><color orange>Accuracy Increase</b></color><br><br>The Hydra chemicals will slightly increase your <color red>accuracy</color>. This will last for one week in game time or until you have hit level 22."
// Choice Description :
"P1597613709" "<b><color orange>Defense Increase</b></color><br><br>The Hydra chemicals will slightly increase your <color red>defense</color>. This will last for one week in game time or until you have hit level 22."
// Choice Description :
"P1057576998" "<b><color orange>Recovery Increase</b></color><br><br>The Hydra chemicals will slightly increase your <color red>recovery</color>. This will last for one week in game time or until you have hit level 22."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table : SL3BloodyBayTrialRewardtable 
// 		Row 2711 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table Description :
"P3375369351" "You have defeated the Neo Shivan Decimator in Bloody Bay and have been empowered by exposure to this radioactive creature!"
// Choice Description :
"P3877356416" "<b><color orange>Damage Increase</b></color><br><br>Exposure to the Shivan Decimator will slightly increase your <color red>damage</color>. This will last for one week in game time or until you have hit level 30."
// Choice Description :
"P1014225471" "<b><color orange>Accuracy Increase</b></color><br><br>Exposure to the Shivan Decimator will slightly increase your <color red>accuracy</color>. This will last for one week in game time or until you have hit level 30."
// Choice Description :
"P3804109781" "<b><color orange>Defense Increase</b></color><br><br>Exposure to the Shivan Decimator will slightly increase your <color red>defense</color>. This will last for one week in game time or until you have hit level 30."
// Choice Description :
"P1398603579" "<b><color orange>Recovery Increase</b></color><br><br>Exposure to the Shivan Decimator will slightly increase your <color red>recovery</color>. This will last for one week in game time or until you have hit level 30."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table : LT_SignatureSummonChoice 
// 		Row 2725 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Table Description :
"P2175399682" "Your loyalty has earned you the ability to summon the aid of a powerful signature hero or villain!"
// Choice Description :
"P2050346862" "<b><color orange>Signature Summon (Tank)</color></b><br><br>Selecting this power will award you 5 charges of a power that will call an Echo of a powerful defensive character to your aid.  If you're a hero, this power will call an Echo of Statesman.  If you're a villain it will call an Echo of Lord Recluse.  Your summoned ally will vanish after 4 minutes, after being defeated or after you zone, whichever happens first.  If you already own this power, you can add 5 additional charges to whatever remaining charges you have left in Signature Summon (Tank)."
// Choice Description :
"P1374343036" "<b><color orange>Signature Summon (Support)</color></b><br><br>Selecting this power will award you 5 charges of a power that will call an Echo of a powerful support character to your aid.  If you're a hero, this power will call an Echo of Manticore.  If you're a villain it will call an Echo of Ghost Widow.  Your summoned ally will vanish after 4 minutes, after being defeated or after you zone, whichever happens first.  If you already own this power, you can add 5 additional charges to whatever remaining charges you have left in Signature Summon (Support)."
// Choice Description :
"P2627862081" "<b><color orange>Signature Summon (Melee Damage)</color></b><br><br>Selecting this power will award you 5 charges of a power that will call an Echo of a powerful melee damage character to your aid.  If you're a hero, this power will call an Echo of Back Alley Brawler.  If you're a villain it will call an Echo of Black Scorpion.  Your summoned ally will vanish after 4 minutes, after being defeated or after you zone, whichever happens first.  If you already own this power, you can add 5 additional charges to whatever remaining charges you have left in Signature Summon (Melee Damage)."
// Choice Description :
"P2950225365" "<b><color orange>Signature Summon (Ranged Damage)</color></b><br><br>Selecting this power will award you 5 charges of a power that will call an Echo of a powerful ranged attack character to your aid.  If you're a hero, this power will call an Echo of Positron.  If you're a villain it will call an Echo of Scirocco  Your summoned ally will vanish after 4 minutes, after being defeated or after you zone, whichever happens first.  If you already own this power, you can add 5 additional charges to whatever remaining charges you have left in Signature Summon (Ranged Damage)."

