// Table Description :
"P204811039" "You have replayed a Signature Story Arc and have earned a reward. Select your reward."
// Choice Description :
"P237454373" "<b><color orange>Hero Merit</b></color><br><br>By choosing this reward, you receive one Hero Alignment Merit redeemable at Fort Trident for a variety of useful items."
// Choice Warning :
"P2899116787" "You do not meet the time constraints for this reward. You can only receive this reward from repeating Signature Story Arcs once every 7 days."
// Choice Warning :
"P3571553480" "You must be a Hero in order to claim this reward."
// Choice Warning :
"P1992606229" "You must have completed your most recent Morality Mission as a Hero reinforcing your Hero alignment to claim this reward."
// Choice Warning :
"P3860655305" "You must be a VIP subscriber or have purchased the Going Rogue System from the Paragon Market to claim this reward."
// Choice Description :
"P1070396748" "<b><color orange>Villain Merit</b></color><br><br>By choosing this reward, you receive one Villain Alignment Merit redeemable at the Crucible for a variety of useful items."
// Choice Warning :
